cluding offline welding, pipe transportation, real-time radiography, SAW pipe cleaning, ultrasonic testing, X-ray cabinet systems, and customized cabinet systems; and equipment for the alloy steel industry, such as pipe rotators and lifters and UT-MFL systems. In addition, the company provides after-sales support services, including maintenance, repair, and technical services. It serves the defense, nuclear and atomic energy, aerospace, mining, steel, automobile, food processing, tooling, and advanced engineering industries. The company was formerly known as Admach Systems Private Limited and changed its name to Admach Systems Limited in October 2024. It was incorporated in 2008 and is based in Pune, India.","employees":56,"earnDates":[],"exDiv":null,"asOf":1795775407},"analyst":null,"cap":"Other","caFix":null,"fetched":1795775407,"source":"Yahoo Finance (public chart, fundamentals-timeseries & quoteSummary endpoints)","news":{"q":"\"Admach Systems\" stock when:90d","items":[{"t":"Price Performance","s":"Yahoo! Finance Canada","d":1795518452,"u":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiWkFVX3lxTE5uaTNYdlN3d1dYYW9PbElwQmRQQk5FLTZMLXZIS19hVjFmWGItV1J5SXNQU2lkWlBJdUdhSmxfVTkzaXEyYU5uV1ZwOXhTTDhhM2NTMDZoN1k5Zw?oc=5","g":[]},{"t":"Admach Systems IPO Details","s":"IPO Watch","d":1794865713,"u":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiW0FVX3lxTE9ENndHZjBTZFJFQjA4ODJSMEZ0Wl92NE1takpfem5kY0s2aV8tSlhDOGt4cWJidTFiQWpXWTN3dXVkOW9RWGRCNExtNGdzRE8zVlVWMjR1R1lSbDg?oc=5","g":["plan"]},{"t":"MEGATHERM Stock Price and Chart — NSE:MEGATHERM","s":"TradingView","d":1794816000,"u":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiX0FVX3lxTE9wNVhTcW81dTZKVGlVbU5OdDZGTHNzZV9TTnhGMTBRMjAyN3VKSU5aVW9HZU03OEh2WU1Udllmc2I2Qk9rdF9GdDd2d0p5WUZrbjhHMGs4d0M3a28tNzNv?oc=5","g":[]},{"t":"Admach Systems Share Price Rises 13.15% Today","s":"Univest","d":1794806160,"u":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihgFBVV95cUxQOThESTB5ZFZwdXZMQ1NoODJ4MUJUeFRQOHUyTzdQeG1QYlZ4Z3pBVzVueFZIaUR1MnZGMmJONXdpMkd3S0V1LUx